-- Input: A tensor of coordinates $x \in \mathbb{R}^{d_{in}}$ (typically $d_{in}=3$ for position, $d_{in}=3$ for view direction).
-- Output: An encoded tensor $z \in \mathbb{R}^{d_{out}}$.
